{"meta":{"id":"tt26672404","type":"series","name":"Agente Butterfly","imdb_id":"tt26672404","description":"La vida de David Jung, un enigmático e impredecible ex agente de los servicios de inteligencia de EE.UU. que vive en Corea del Sur, se desmorona cuando las consecuencias de una decisión imposible de su pasado vuelven a atormentarle. Se ve perseguido por Rebecca, una joven agente mortal y sociópata asignada para matarle, y también por Caddis, la siniestra organización de espionaje para la que trabaja.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt26672404.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kPOm8uBC7ajkjCWC0NM2lRbhRLs.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v7U6PXid0tMNX5YkjNSdS6gGnOX.png","genres":["Action & Adventure","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-08-13T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Canceled","imdbRating":"6.7","country":"United States of America","cast":["Daniel Dae Kim","Reina Hardesty","Piper Perabo","Louis Landau"],"writer":["Steph Cha","Ken Woodruff","Arash Amel","Sung Rno","Ashley Darnall","Mason Hsieh","Aaron Lam","Blaize Ali-Watkins"],"trailers":[{"source":"RBmyiyZba3s","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"RBmyiyZba3s","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"RBmyiyZba3s","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"6.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt26672404"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Daniel Dae Kim","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Daniel%20Dae%20Kim"},{"name":"Reina Hardesty","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Reina%20Hardesty"},{"name":"Piper Perabo","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Piper%20Perabo"},{"n